["<aside class=\"callout why\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>No licence, no hunt. Deer tags by mail take about 14 days. Buy them in person.</p></aside>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"What each hunt needs. Deer: a BC hunting licence plus a deer tag. Ducks and geese: a BC hunting licence plus the federal bird permit. Quail and grouse: a BC hunting licence only.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What each hunt needs</text>\n  <g stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"118\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"118\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"204\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"204\"/></g>\n  <!-- deer -->\n  <g transform=\"translate(40 70)\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\">\n    <ellipse rx=\"20\" ry=\"10\"/><rect x=\"-16\" y=\"5\" width=\"4\" height=\"18\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"5\" width=\"4\" height=\"18\"/>\n    <path d=\"M14 -4 L24 -20 L32 -18 L22 0 Z\"/><path d=\"M26 -20 l-4 -10 M30 -20 l6 -9\" stroke=\"#5c3b1c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  </g>\n  <text x=\"18\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Deer</text>\n  <!-- duck -->\n  <g transform=\"translate(42 162)\">\n    <ellipse rx=\"20\" ry=\"11\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"-10\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#2f6b3a\"/><path d=\"M25 -10 l10 3 l-10 2 Z\" fill=\"#e8b10c\"/>\n  </g>\n  <text x=\"14\" y=\"198\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Ducks</text>\n  <!-- grouse -->\n  <g transform=\"translate(42 245)\">\n    <ellipse rx=\"18\" ry=\"13\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"-10\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><path d=\"M-16 -2 l-12 -8 l2 14 Z\" fill=\"#5c3b1c\"/>\n  </g>\n  <text x=\"10\" y=\"286\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Grouse, quail</text>\n  <g font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <rect x=\"120\" y=\"58\" width=\"120\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"86\" fill=\"#fff\">BC licence</text>\n    <text x=\"255\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">+</text>\n    <rect x=\"270\" y=\"58\" width=\"120\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"86\" fill=\"#fff\">Deer tag</text>\n    <rect x=\"120\" y=\"140\" width=\"120\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"168\" fill=\"#fff\">BC licence</text>\n    <text x=\"255\" y=\"169\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">+</text>\n    <rect x=\"270\" y=\"140\" width=\"120\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"160\" fill=\"#fff\">Federal</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"178\" fill=\"#fff\">bird permit</text>\n    <rect x=\"120\" y=\"226\" width=\"120\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"254\" fill=\"#fff\">BC licence</text>\n    <text x=\"300\" y=\"254\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">That is all</text>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Mule deer and white tailed deer are <strong>separate</strong> tags <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the table and the fine print</summary><div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Hunting</th><th>You need</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Deer</td><td>BC hunting licence + deer species licence (tag) for that species</td></tr><tr><td>Ducks and geese</td><td>BC hunting licence + federal bird permit</td></tr><tr><td>Quail and grouse</td><td>BC hunting licence only</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>Residents need no species licence for quail or grouse <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>Ducks and geese need no BC species licence, only the federal permit <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>Mule deer and white tailed deer are <strong>separate</strong> species licences <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Your FWID is your old hunter number plus 3 extra digits. No card needed. Carry photo ID and know the number.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Your FWID, your hunter number</text>\n  <g font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <rect x=\"14\" y=\"50\" width=\"150\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <text x=\"89\" y=\"76\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Old hunter</text><text x=\"89\" y=\"96\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">number</text>\n    <text x=\"180\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">+</text>\n    <rect x=\"196\" y=\"50\" width=\"90\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n    <text x=\"241\" y=\"76\" fill=\"#fff\">3 extra</text><text x=\"241\" y=\"96\" fill=\"#fff\">digits</text>\n    <text x=\"304\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">=</text>\n    <rect x=\"318\" y=\"50\" width=\"72\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"354\" y=\"86\" fill=\"#fff\">FWID</text>\n  </g>\n  <!-- wallet -->\n  <rect x=\"30\" y=\"150\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/>\n  <rect x=\"44\" y=\"164\" width=\"122\" height=\"72\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"72\" cy=\"192\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><rect x=\"58\" y=\"210\" width=\"28\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/>\n  <g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><rect x=\"96\" y=\"184\" width=\"58\" height=\"6\"/><rect x=\"96\" y=\"198\" width=\"44\" height=\"6\"/><rect x=\"96\" y=\"212\" width=\"52\" height=\"6\"/></g>\n  <text x=\"105\" y=\"272\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Carry photo ID</text>\n  <!-- head with number -->\n  <circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"196\" r=\"34\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"290\" y=\"202\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">FWID #</text>\n  <text x=\"290\" y=\"252\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Know the number</text>\n  <text x=\"290\" y=\"272\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No card needed</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li><button class=\"term\" data-term=\"FWID\">FWID</button> (Fish and Wildlife ID) = your old hunter number + 3 digits <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>Carry <strong>photo ID</strong>. Know the number. No card needed (95 to 99%).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: how to find it</summary><ul><li>Your old hunter number is now the FWID <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>It is your old hunter number with 3 extra digits <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>No card or printout needed. Knowing the number is enough <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>You must carry <strong>photo ID</strong> and be able to give your FWID number when an officer asks <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>Not sure of yours? Log in to WILD (Wildlife Information and Licensing Data) and use <strong>Find my FWID</strong> <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>No luck? FrontCounter BC: 1 877 855 3222 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The BC hunting licence runs from 1 April to 31 March. Adult resident cost 32 dollars: a 25 dollar fee plus a 7 dollar surcharge, plus GST. It is electronic only, on your phone or in WILD.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">BC hunting licence</text>\n  <rect x=\"20\" y=\"52\" width=\"360\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">\n    <text x=\"50\" y=\"74\">Apr</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"74\">Jun</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"74\">Aug</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"74\">Oct</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"74\">Dec</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"74\">Mar</text>\n  </g>\n  <rect x=\"216\" y=\"48\" width=\"30\" height=\"42\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <text x=\"231\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Hunt</text>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Starts 1 April</text>\n  <text x=\"380\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"end\">Ends 31 March</text>\n  <g font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <rect x=\"20\" y=\"132\" width=\"90\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"163\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">$25 fee</text>\n    <text x=\"124\" y=\"164\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">+</text>\n    <rect x=\"138\" y=\"132\" width=\"110\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"193\" y=\"154\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">$7</text><text x=\"193\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">surcharge</text>\n    <text x=\"262\" y=\"164\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">=</text>\n    <rect x=\"276\" y=\"132\" width=\"104\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"328\" y=\"163\" fill=\"#fff\">$32 + GST</text>\n  </g>\n  <!-- phone -->\n  <rect x=\"150\" y=\"200\" width=\"56\" height=\"88\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><rect x=\"156\" y=\"210\" width=\"44\" height=\"66\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\"/>\n  <path d=\"M166 244 l8 8 l16 -18\" stroke=\"#2f6b3a\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\"/>\n  <text x=\"222\" y=\"238\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Electronic only</text>\n  <text x=\"222\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">No paper needed</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Good 1 April to 31 March. $32 plus GST (Goods and Services Tax) <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>Electronic only. Buy it online tonight <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: cost and where to buy</summary><ul><li>It is good for the licence year, 1 April to 31 March. It expires 31 March <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>Adult resident cost: $32. That is a $25 fee plus a $7 conservation surcharge <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>GST is not included in that price <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>It is <strong>electronic only</strong>. You need no paper copy while hunting <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>Buy online, or at Service BC, FrontCounter BC or a participating store <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Deer tags. Ordered online, they come by mail in about 14 business days. Bought in person at Service BC, FrontCounter BC or a vendor, you get them the same day. They cannot be printed at home.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Deer tags: how fast?</text>\n  <!-- online lane -->\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Online order</text>\n  <rect x=\"20\" y=\"72\" width=\"360\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\"/>\n  <rect x=\"20\" y=\"72\" width=\"360\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" opacity=\".7\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Mailed: about 14 business days</text>\n  <!-- envelope -->\n  <rect x=\"300\" y=\"104\" width=\"60\" height=\"38\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M300 104 l30 20 l30 -20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Too slow for a hunt in 2 weeks</text>\n  <!-- in person lane -->\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">In person</text>\n  <rect x=\"20\" y=\"190\" width=\"70\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <text x=\"100\" y=\"206\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\">Same day</text>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Service BC, FrontCounter BC, vendor</text>\n  <!-- no printer -->\n  <g transform=\"translate(320 222)\">\n    <rect x=\"-26\" y=\"-14\" width=\"52\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><rect x=\"-16\" y=\"-28\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n    <line x1=\"-34\" y1=\"-34\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"28\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"5\"/>\n  </g>\n  <text x=\"320\" y=\"272\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No home printing</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Hunting in the next 2 weeks? <strong>Buy in person</strong> <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>$15 each plus GST (Goods and Services Tax). Carry all your tags, used and unused <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: prices, mail times, waiting periods</summary><ul><li>Mule deer: $15. White tailed deer: $15. Each is a $12 fee plus a $3 surcharge <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>Plus 5% GST <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li><strong>Cannot be printed at home.</strong> They are printed on special paper with unique numbers <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>Online orders are mailed. Allow about 14 business days to a BC address <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Hunting in the next 2 weeks? <strong>Buy in person</strong> at Service BC, FrontCounter BC or a licence vendor. You get them right away <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li><strong>No waiting period for deer.</strong> The 2 day wait applies only to bobcat, caribou, cougar, lynx, mountain goat, mountain sheep and wolverine <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>Carry <strong>all</strong> your species licences for the year, used and unused <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li></ul></details><aside class=\"callout lean\"><div class=\"callout-t\">My lean (opinion)</div><p>Buy both a mule deer and a white tailed deer tag. $30 plus GST. You will not know which deer walks out first.</p></aside>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Federal Migratory Game Bird Hunting Permit. 8 dollars 50 for the permit plus 8 dollars 50 for the habitat stamp equals 17 dollars. It expires 30 June. Carry it on paper or on your phone.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Federal bird permit</text>\n  <g font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <rect x=\"20\" y=\"50\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"82\" fill=\"#fff\">Permit</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"108\" fill=\"#fff\">$8.50</text>\n    <text x=\"156\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">+</text>\n    <rect x=\"172\" y=\"56\" width=\"80\" height=\"68\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/>\n    <ellipse cx=\"212\" cy=\"80\" rx=\"16\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/><circle cx=\"226\" cy=\"74\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#2f6b3a\"/>\n    <text x=\"212\" y=\"112\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">$8.50</text>\n    <text x=\"212\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Habitat stamp</text>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">=</text>\n    <rect x=\"290\" y=\"62\" width=\"90\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"335\" y=\"97\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\">$17</text>\n  </g>\n  <rect x=\"20\" y=\"176\" width=\"170\" height=\"90\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"20\" y=\"176\" width=\"170\" height=\"26\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <text x=\"105\" y=\"195\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Expires</text>\n  <text x=\"105\" y=\"242\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">30 June</text>\n  <rect x=\"250\" y=\"172\" width=\"56\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><rect x=\"256\" y=\"182\" width=\"44\" height=\"72\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" opacity=\".6\"/>\n  <text x=\"278\" y=\"224\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">e</text>\n  <text x=\"320\" y=\"214\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Phone</text>\n  <text x=\"320\" y=\"234\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">or paper</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Needed every time you hunt ducks or geese <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>. Buy online, save it on your phone (85 to 99%).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: name, dates and tax</summary><ul><li>Name: Migratory Game Bird Hunting Permit <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>The habitat conservation stamp must be on it. You pay for it with the permit <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>Cost: $17. That is $8.50 for the permit plus $8.50 for the stamp <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>. Plus tax <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">80%</span>.</li><li>It expires 30 June after you buy it <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>. The 2026 e permit runs 1 August 2026 to 30 June 2027 <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">80%</span>.</li><li>Buy online <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>. Save the e permit on your phone <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li><li>Carry it every time you hunt ducks or geese <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>. Paper or phone both count <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two hunters, each with their own licence and tags. Passing a tag to your brother is not allowed. The hunter who kills the deer cancels his own tag.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Each hunter, own tags</text>\n  <g fill=\"#2f3a2b\">\n    <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"80\" r=\"18\"/><rect x=\"70\" y=\"100\" width=\"40\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"80\" r=\"18\"/><rect x=\"290\" y=\"100\" width=\"40\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\"/>\n  </g>\n  <rect x=\"70\" y=\"102\" width=\"40\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><rect x=\"290\" y=\"102\" width=\"40\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <text x=\"90\" y=\"196\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">You</text>\n  <text x=\"310\" y=\"196\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Brother</text>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <rect x=\"30\" y=\"210\" width=\"120\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"230\" fill=\"#fff\">Own licence</text>\n    <rect x=\"30\" y=\"246\" width=\"120\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"266\" fill=\"#fff\">Own tags</text>\n    <rect x=\"250\" y=\"210\" width=\"120\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"230\" fill=\"#fff\">Own licence</text>\n    <rect x=\"250\" y=\"246\" width=\"120\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"266\" fill=\"#fff\">Own tags</text>\n  </g>\n  <!-- tag passing crossed -->\n  <path d=\"M140 120 L260 120\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 5\"/>\n  <path d=\"M250 112 l12 8 l-12 8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <rect x=\"182\" y=\"96\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"6\"/><line x1=\"230\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c0392b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No sharing</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>His <strong>own</strong> licence, deer tags and bird permit. No sharing <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>The hunter who kills cancels <strong>his own</strong> tag, right away <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: helpers and party hunting</summary><ul><li>He has CORE (Conservation and Outdoor Recreation Education), a PAL (Possession and Acquisition Licence) and an FWID (Fish and Wildlife ID). He can hunt too.</li><li>He needs his <strong>own</strong> BC hunting licence, his <strong>own</strong> deer species licences and his <strong>own</strong> federal bird permit <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>Licences cannot be lent, shared or transferred <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>Each hunter fills <strong>their own</strong> tags. The hunter who kills cancels his own licence, right away <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>You cannot notch your tag for his deer. BC has no party hunting rule <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Anyone without a licence can still come along to watch and help pack out, if they carry no firearm or other weapon <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>The licensed hunter stays with the meat, unless the helper carries a Record of Receipt <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"checklist\" data-list=\"s2-buy\"><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s2-buy:0\"><span>Find my FWID in WILD</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s2-buy:1\"><span>Buy BC hunting licence (online is fine, it is electronic)</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s2-buy:2\"><span>Buy mule deer licence IN PERSON</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s2-buy:3\"><span>Buy white tailed deer licence IN PERSON</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s2-buy:4\"><span>Buy federal bird permit online, save to phone</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s2-buy:5\"><span>Photo ID and PAL card in wallet</span></label></div><aside class=\"callout rule\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Licences in a zip bag, same pocket every time. Check the pocket before you leave the truck.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout mistake\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Deer tags ordered online a week before. Too late.</li><li>Thinking the BC licence covers ducks.</li><li>Used tags left at home.</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Open WILD tonight. Find your FWID. Pencil it on the back of your PAL card.</p></aside>","<ul><li>All fees, dates and rules: BC Synopsis, BC laws and federal law, read directly (95 to 99%). Federal tax and phone copy lines: 80 to 85%.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: all sources</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://www2.gov.bc.ca/assets/gov/sports-recreation-arts-and-culture/outdoor-recreation/fishing-and-hunting/hunting/regulations/hunting-trapping-synopsis.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BC Hunting and Trapping Regulations Synopsis 2026 to 2028</a>, read directly, the page 8 fee table checked on the rendered page image. Page 3 (licence year), page 5 (FWID, electronic licences, carry all species licences, in person means right away), page 6 (personal bag limit), page 7 (federal permit, separate deer licences), page 8 (fees, the 2 day wait list, where to buy, electronic only, no transfers), page 11 item 2 (no using or lending a licence). Checked 2026-10-02 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.bclaws.gov.bc.ca/civix/document/id/complete/statreg/8_99\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hunting Licensing Regulation, B.C. Reg. 8/99</a>, read directly, current to 22 September 2026: s. 5(1) (which species need a species licence), s. 6 (2 day wait list), s. 7(1) (the hunter who kills cancels at once). Checked 2026-10-02 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/sports-culture/recreation/fishing-hunting/hunting/species-licences\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BC species licences page</a>, read directly: $12 fee plus $3 surcharge per deer licence, 5% GST extra, online orders mailed, buy in person to get them at once. Checked 2026-10-02 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/sports-culture/recreation/fishing-hunting/wild-system/fish-wildlife-id\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BC Fish and Wildlife ID page</a>, read directly: carry photo ID and produce your FWID, 3 extra digits, Find my FWID. Checked 2026-10-02 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/sports-culture/recreation/fishing-hunting/hunting/frequently-asked-questions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BC hunting FAQ</a>, read directly: special paper, about 14 days by mail, unlicensed companions and the meat. Checked 2026-10-02 (95 to 99%)</li><li><a href=\"https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/regulations/SOR-2022-105/FullText.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Migratory Birds Regulations, 2022 (SOR/2022-105)</a>, read directly, current to 2026-09-21: s. 31 (habitat stamp), s. 33 (expires 30 June), s. 34 (carry the permit), Schedule 2 ($8.50 permit, $8.50 stamp). Checked 2026-10-02 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/environment-climate-change/services/migratory-game-bird-hunting/permit.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ECCC (Environment and Climate Change Canada) permit page</a>, search preview only (still blocked here): tax, the 2026 permit dates, phone copy. Checked 2026-10-01 (80 to 85%)</li></ul></details>"]